{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[],"persons":[{"id":"xunyu-p0094","name":"孟轲","evidence":["xunyu-q-p045","zhuge-q-o078"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"xunyu-m-p045-xunyu-p0094","kind":"allusion","text":"祖系或典故提及","evidence":["xunyu-q-p045"]},{"id":"zhuge-m-o078-xunyu-p0094","kind":"allusion","text":"祖系或典故提及","evidence":["zhuge-q-o078"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"xunyu-q-p045","section":"chapter-010","block":"b-1f681e9c1969f853b886","layer":"pei","quote":"《傅子》曰：“或问近世大贤君子，答曰：‘荀令君之仁，荀军师之智，斯可谓近世大贤君子矣。荀令君仁以立德，明以举贤；行无谄黩，谋能应机。孟轲称“五百年而有王者兴，其间必有命世者”，其荀令君乎！太祖称“荀令君之进善，不进不休；荀军师之去恶，不去不止”也。’”","attribution":"《傅子》","section_title":"荀彧荀攸贾诩传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0025.xhtml","index":264,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-9e866dbe98d2e7f1dedc","start":0,"end":126,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhuge-q-o078","section":"chapter-035","block":"b-fa33479f36418632b336","layer":"original","quote":"青龙二年春，亮帅众出武功；分兵屯田，为久驻之基。其秋病卒。黎庶追思〖29〗，以为口实〖30〗。至今梁、益之民，咨述亮者〖31〗，言犹在耳；虽《甘棠》之咏召公〖32〗，郑人之歌子产〖33〗，无以远譬也〖34〗。孟轲有云〖35〗：“以逸道使民〖36〗，虽劳不怨；以生道杀人〖37〗，虽死不忿。”信矣！","section_title":"诸葛亮传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0076.xhtml","index":349,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":148,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
